10 REM HELLO FROM THE APPLE II
20 REM THE TEXT SCREEN HAS NO COLOUR: INVFLG AT 50 IS ITS WHOLE ATTRIBUTE
30 REM MODEL, AND COUT ANDS EVERY CHARACTER WITH IT - 255 NORMAL, 63 INVERSE
40 REM 127 IS NOT A THIRD MODE. AN AND CANNOT RAISE A BIT, SO IT FLASHES THE
50 REM LETTERS AND LEAVES SPACE, PUNCTUATION AND DIGITS INVERSE
60 TEXT
70 CALL -936
80 FOR I=1 TO 20
90 POKE 50,255
100 IF I MOD 2=1 THEN POKE 50,63
110 VTAB I
120 TAB I MOD 17+1
130 PRINT "HELLO FROM THE APPLE II"
140 NEXT I
150 POKE 50,63
160 VTAB 23
170 TAB 14
180 REM THE TRAILING ; HOLDS BACK THE CARRIAGE RETURN THAT WOULD SCROLL THE
190 REM SCREEN AND TAKE THE TOP OF THE CASCADE WITH IT
200 PRINT "* BASICALLY *";
210 POKE 50,255
220 END
